mber","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T13:02:09-08:00","id":29482,"title":"","content":"I think the wiki said the list of priorities goes:<br /> <br /> 1) House rules<br /> 2) Hacks from <b>Shards of the Exalted Dream</b><br /> 3) <b>Scroll of Errata</b><br /> 4) Core book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T13:09:52-08:00","id":29486,"title":"","content":"Ouch... I bowed out of Second around Sidereals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/448-dulahan","name":"Dulahan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T14:27:31-08:00","id":29524,"title":"","content":"My exact thought process went, &quot;Cool, a new Exalted MUSH I can get in on the ground floor of! And it's in Great Forks! I can do that Zenith Mafia don I've been wanting to do aw fuck it'll be second edition, won't it. God damn it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":". 12-13-2013, 05:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T20:46:14-08:00","id":29693,"title":"","content":"Yeah we're using all the latest rules and even brought in a few 3e inspired things from the previews (slight changes to how we spin Abyssals and Infernals mostly.) It's 2.5e, but we've done as much as possible with the House Rules to smooth things out.<br /> <br /> I wasn't aware that people still use 1e a lot. Do they?<br /> <br /> Side note: there is considerable interest among our playerbase in 3e and we hope to leap onto that as soon as it's practical. (Which might be several months after it's released - we'd like at least two or three char types besides Solars available...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1652-volund","name":"Volund","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T10:07:52-08:00","id":29974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volund</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/28984-exalted-mush-where-rivers-meet?p=29693#post29693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah we're using all the latest rules and even brought in a few 3e inspired things from the previews (slight changes to how we spin Abyssals and Infernals mostly.) It's 2.5e, but we've done as much as possible with the House Rules to smooth things out.<br /> <br /> I wasn't aware that people still use 1e a lot. Do they?<br /> <br /> Side note: there is considerable interest among our playerbase in 3e and we hope to leap onto that as soon as it's practical. (Which might be several months after it's released - we'd like at least two or three char types besides Solars available...)</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I'm not entirely sure I'd even play in a 2e TT game. Far prefer 1e to it. And I know at least on the RPGnet discussions and a lot of the 3e discussions I've seen there's a lot of 1e people about in general. Half the point of 3e is trying to draw us back. And what I'm hearing probably will! At least enough I backed for the CE!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/448-dulahan","name":"Dulahan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T20:10:26-08:00","id":30235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volund</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/28984-exalted-mush-where-rivers-meet?p=29693#post29693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wasn't aware that people still use first edition a lot. Do they?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not personally aware of anyone doing so, and I wasn't expecting your game to be first edition. I was more talking about the moment when my excitement was crushed by the memory of why I quit playing Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}